msgstr "快速同步问题恢复时间（100ms 至 150ms）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:18
#: 0228f98ac9aa4fac8208c78834422c9d 04c80b632a7442638647a6bd500ae86c
#: 2e0ce9c8df284441bedf8c48c2e919c7 fde0357b715848bbbdfb716f54e66372
