#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:62
#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:67
#: a9af093417104e6b99883593efe28907 d57e95b1163a4b36a54ea0a9b622db95
#: dfc39d8572c142ebbfdb52955bd0615e efc964fc40f64690af9d539d355b032f
msgid ""
"ToshibaCAN ESCs provide information back to the autopilot which is recorded "
"in the autopilot's onboard log's ESCn messages and can be viewed in any "
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This information "
"includes:"
msgstr ""
"ToshibaCAN 电调向飞控反馈信息，记录在飞控机载日志的 ESCn 消息中，可通过任何 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:66
#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:69
